{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"APPROVED RP-04 decision: unavoidable static credentials use Pydantic SecretStr/SecretBytes only inside provider-specific, non-serializable static-auth containers. Secret fields are excluded from repr, comparison, hashing, caching, and fingerprints; operation snapshots are structurally unable to contain the wrappers; the value is explicitly unwrapped only inside the sending adapter. Pydantic masking is defense in depth, not storage or memory protection, so the existing canary leakage matrix remains required. Updated the research decision inventory and verification matrix; Gitleaks found no leaks."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786937502551245001,"uuid":"68ed4774-e0d6-423c-80dd-d81777ac4811"}